type: dataset
title: Supplementary raw data on cell chaining in an attenuated Listeria monocytogenes
  mutant
abstract: The dataset "Supplementary raw data on cell chaining in an attenuated Listeria
  monocytogenes mutant" provides the raw images and data for the manuscript "On the
  role of cell chaining in the attenuation of a Listeria monocytogenes divIVA mutant"
  (https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.01.05.697648).
